(7424128, 1171790, 12253, '<td valign="top">Well done--I like the water droplets everywhere.  BTW, perhaps all the CA people should move east...it''s warm here in upstate NY.  Ok, well warm for us now is anything above 40.  It was 70 yesterday.  Today in the 50s.</td>', 'Well done--I like the water droplets everywhere.  BTW, perhaps all the CA people should move east...it''s warm here in upstate NY.  Ok, well warm for us now is anything above 40.  It was 70 yesterday.  Today in the 50s.', '2015-12-25 13:07:17.000000', NULL, 0),
