(7424137, 1171927, 86447, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club, Susan!<br/> <br/>Wow!  What an image!  I have NO idea why the score is so low.   So... maybe I''m not the one to critique this for you.  <br/> <br/>I gave it a seven during voting.<br/> <br/>I''m guessing that the other voters did not see the swim suit and the two heads/body in the pours.  It''s brilliant.<br/> <br/>*sigh*<br/> <br/>Including the vessels was good advice.  It definitely gives more to the story.<br/> <br/>I can''t imagine how hard it is to do this.  But, I''m sure it would have taken me more than it took you.<br/> <br/>The colors are wonderful.  The composition is perfect.  The whites are white.  <br/> <br/>I just don''t understand the score.   <br/> <br/>Silly voters.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club, Susan! Wow!  What an image!  I have NO idea why the score is so low.   So... maybe I''m not the one to critique this for you.   I gave it a seven during voting. I''m guessing that the other voters did not see the swim suit and the two heads/body in the pours.  It''s brilliant. *sigh* Including the vessels was good advice.  It definitely gives more to the story. I can''t imagine how hard it is to do this.  But, I''m sure it would have taken me more than it took you. The colors are wonderful.  The composition is perfect.  The whites are white.   I just don''t understand the score.    Silly voters. ', '2015-12-25 17:38:31.000000', NULL, 0),
